                    overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,
                  ),
                ),
              ),
              // RIGHT: page action, or the reserved empty slot.
              actionButton ?? const SizedBox(width: 44),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}

